# Documentation rules

- Keep docs concise and actionable; avoid speculative implementation detail.
- Open questions belong in `docs/architecture/open-decisions.md` or a Proposed ADR.
- Domain briefs stay capability-focused: purpose, responsibilities, non-responsibilities, dependencies.
- When resolving an open decision, add an ADR and link it from the open-decisions index.
- Do not invent production metrics, SLAs, or stack choices inside docs without marking them as open/TBD.
